Hi Curtis,
you are right that we removed 1.3.1 and 2.0.0 is not yet tested on CDH3. Nonetheless it passed on CDH4 and I am confident the same is going to happen with CDH3. Give me one more day and I will be able to confirm it. If you really have to stick with the old version, I've just added some instructions <https://github.com/RevolutionAnalytics/RHadoop/wiki/Downloads> on how to create the old builds. By the way, if you re-create 1.3.1 it will show a version number of 1.3 because of operator error (I added the tag before bumping the version). Other than that it is a 1.3.1 byte by byte.

Antonio

